# Delegation

- The parent decomposes, dispatches, integrates, and judges. Cheap orientation reads and trivial one-file edits stay in the parent. Do not dump large files into the parent.
- Offload substantial or parallelizable work to Task subagents.
- After subagent results, the next parent move is dispatch or verify — not absorbing remaining substantial implementation.
